 "ocr_text": "# --- | Page 1 | --- #\n\nGroupe Horizon SA                                              MASTER SERVICES\n12 Rue de la République, 13001 Marseille, France              AGREEMENT\nN° TVA: FR43 446636774\nReg No: FR-912112\n\nFROM                                                         FACTURÉ À\n\nGroupe Horizon SA                                            Atelier Provence SAS\n12 Rue de la République                                      12 Rue de la République\n13001 Marseille                                              13001 Marseille\nFrance                                                       France\nVAT: FR43 446636774\n\nThis master services agreement (the \"Agreement\") is entered into as of 17/02/2026 (the \"Effective Date\") by and between Groupe\nHorizon SA, with its registered office at 12 Rue de la République, Marseille (\"Party A\"), and Atelier Provence SAS, with its registered\noffice at 12 Rue de la République, Marseille (\"Party B\").\n\n1. Term\n\nThis Agreement shall remain in force for a period of 24 months from the Effective Date unless terminated earlier in accordance with\nSection 7.\n\n2. Confidentiality\n\nEach party shall keep confidential all non-public information received from the other party and shall use it solely for the purposes of this\nAgreement.\n\n3. Governing Law\n\nThis Agreement shall be governed by the laws of the State of New York.\n\nSignatures\n\nParty A      Groupe Horizon SA / Sophie Bernard\nParty B      Atelier Provence SAS / Sophie Bernard\nDate         17/02/2026",
